#chip 16F877A, 20

'Change1660 test: SHARED on a mid-range PIC (banked RAM). Two 16-byte buffers purposely at the
'same location. Expect: compiles with no warnings; BUFFERA and BUFFERB both at 0xA0.

Dim BufferA(15) As Byte At 0xA0 SHARED
Dim BufferB(15) As Byte At 0xA0 SHARED

BufferA(1) = 1
BufferB(2) = 2

Do
Loop
